[SIZE=5][B]8. Real-Time Operations & Observability[/B][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][B]HTML Operations Dashboard:[/B] Built-in web dashboard on a dedicated port with live lobby tables, latency charts, and bearer token authentication.
[*][B]Prometheus & Grafana Metrics:[/B] Native /metrics endpoint exporting routing counts, circuit trips, health latency, and queue depths.
[*][B]Dynamic MOTD Rotation:[/B] MiniMessage MOTD rotation (random, sequential, scheduled) with live player counts and maintenance indicators.
[*][B]Configuration Validation:[/B] /vn config validate and /vn menu validate with Levenshtein typo suggestions.
[/LIST]

[CENTER][IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DemonZ-Development/VelocityNavigator/main/assets/marketplace/07-localization.png[/IMG][/CENTER]

[SIZE=5][B]9. Global Localization (15 Languages)[/B][/SIZE]

Bundled translations for English, Spanish, German, French, Russian, Portuguese (Brazil), Chinese (Simplified), Japanese, Korean, Italian, Dutch, Polish, Turkish, Arabic, and Hindi. Reloadable custom .properties files supported.

[SIZE=5][B]10. Multi-Engine Storage[/B][/SIZE]

Supports JSON files, SQLite, MySQL, MariaDB, and PostgreSQL with HikariCP connection pooling and automatic schema migrations.

[SIZE=5][B]11. Five-Minute Quick Start[/B][/SIZE]

[LIST=1]
[*]Put VelocityNavigator-4.5.0.jar in Velocity's plugins/ directory.
[*]Start the proxy once to generate default configuration, then open plugins/velocitynavigator/navigator.toml.
[*]Configure your lobby pool:
[/LIST]

[CODE=toml]
[routing]
selection_mode = "power_of_two"
balance_initial_join = true
default_lobbies = ["lobby-1", "lobby-2", "lobby-3"]
[/CODE]

[LIST=4]
[*]Run /vn config validate, then start the proxy.
[*]Join and test with /lobby!
[/LIST]

[SIZE=5][B]12. Command Reference[/B][/SIZE]

[B]Admin Commands (permission: velocitynavigator.admin):[/B]
[LIST]
[*][B]/vn health[/B] - Consolidated proxy diagnostics and circuit health
[*][B]/vn servers[/B] - Paginated table of server health, capacity, drain, circuits
[*][B]/vn debug player <player>[/B] - Live trace explaining routing decision
[*][B]/vn drain <server>[/B] - Toggle drain mode for zero-downtime maintenance
[*][B]/vn maintenance [server] [on/off][/B] - Toggle network or per-server maintenance
[*][B]/vn affinity clean[/B] - Purge expired player affinity sessions
[*][B]/vn bridge status[/B] - Show detected backend bridge connections
[*][B]/vn config validate[/B] - Audit configuration for errors or typos
[*][B]/vn menu validate[/B] - Validate menu items, slots, and materials
[*][B]/vn reload[/B] - Hot-reload all configs and language packs
[/LIST]

